# ButtonGroup - segmented row of buttons that share borders. Put `btn btn-outline` buttons inside:
#   ButtonGroup { Button "Bold" -> b class("btn btn-outline")  Button "Italic" -> i class("btn btn-outline") }
# shadcn-for-muten · part · no deps · uses .btn-group from globals.css.
part ButtonGroup() { Stack class("btn-group") { slot } }
